Z||000017||mwbackus||08-21-99||10:33 AM||||This guy??? Do even know who Herb Adams is?  If you did you would not even consider saying something stupid like that!!  If you really think an airfilter is going to get you more HP then fine, waste your money, I couldnt care less!  Maybe you should plaster some nice K&N stickers on your car too.  I hear the stickers are good for a couple ponies.  The dyno tests (K & N vs. Stock) you refer to have already been done, and they did not show any significant HP increase.  The $30 to $40 you waste on the  stupid filter could have been invested in some real mods that do increase performance.<p>Mike<p>
